{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03868","headline":"二月乐游诗 · 郭震","name":"二月乐游诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二月芳游始，开轩望晓池。\n绿兰日吐叶，红蘂向盈枝。\n柳色行将改，君心幸莫移。\n阳春遽多意，唯愿两人知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}